# Skill Usage

Before implementation:

Check whether an existing skill solves the task.

If yes:

Use the skill.

Do not reimplement.

---

If multiple skills exist:

Choose the most specialized.

---

Never ignore an available skill.

---

If a skill provides best practices:

Follow them exactly.

